      "id": "k-edit",
      "type": "sticky",
      "text": "**Resolve session** takes the current draft as *before*.\n**spec.validate**: state checks — existence, kind, lock state.\n**spec.apply**: the mutation; returns an applied draft or a no-op.\nAn ERROR or a NO-OP leaves the draft as it was and fires no event.",
